# Implementation Plan — Sprint-003A: Browser Engine & Overlay Integration

> **Sprint Goal**: Implement the **Browser Foundation Engine** and **Browser Panel UI** (`src/browser/`), integrating a high-performance web view into the `batmanoverlay` frameless window stack with custom navigation controls, security sandboxing, and overlay integration.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> PySide6 `QWebEngineView` (Chromium engine) will be encapsulated behind clean interface protocols (`IBrowserService`) in `src/browser/protocols.py`, adhering to SAD §4 Layered Architecture contracts (`ui` $\rightarrow$ `browser` $\rightarrow$ `core`).

> [!NOTE]
> `QWebEngineView` will be configured with privacy and security defaults (sandboxed profile, persistent cookie/cache path in `data/sessions/browser`, disabled camera/microphone permissions by default).

